Open src/widgets/lengthSlider.tsx and adjust it:
- Keep using Animated.Value and Animated.timing so the rulers glide as the value changes.
- Fix the touch/drag handling so swiping the bar cannot snap back to the previous position when released.
- Ensure the ruler is visually centered on the selected duration at every value.
- Remove the uneven fading near the ends; tick marks should have consistent opacity across the visible ruler.
- Preserve the existing gradient blue track, white thumb, labels, and tick layout.
- Keep the component API unchanged.

